    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Sleep: The dominant has come is a suspense, deduction, and romance-themed AVG game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game plays with a special mental jury mechanic. The goal is not to uncover the real truth, but to stand on your side and push backwards to defeat the opposing side, gain more spiritual followers, and win the trial's ultimate victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426060/extras/2e39b9f9afcd0d0afe51194ee07064c1.avif?t=1745311653\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dream Search</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the dream realm where the sun and moon are divided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire evidence in the gap between spirit and reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spirit Trial</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A spiritual jury system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More important than the truth is the will of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the human and physical evidence in your hands to win the trial.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reality Gaming</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperation, confrontation or betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The two protagonists are heading for different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The future of the world will be determined by you as you fight for your beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426060/extras/63b67d722487135814612fd59e891f5b.avif?t=1745311653\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Male and female protagonists</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Male detective and female detective, totally different character and choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual Narrative</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dramatic changes in the situation, switching between different positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426060/extras/b95429ce509193d630591e5895896c8e.avif?t=1745311653\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro-future style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate between dream and reality, retro and avant-garde colors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different\u00a0characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build bonds of love and hate with characters that transcend the constraints of tradition and reality.</p>",
