raph\">Male detective and female detective, totally different character and choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual Narrative</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dramatic changes in the situation, switching between different positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426060/extras/b95429ce509193d630591e5895896c8e.avif?t=1745311653\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro-future style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate between dream and reality, retro and avant-garde colors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different\u00a0characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build bonds of love and hate with characters that transcend the constraints of tradition and reality.</p>",
